{
  "id": 800,
  "description": "# Welcome to the Guild\n\n- Casual / No requirements\n- No discord\n- Raids on schedule 16:30 UTC (or 12:30 pm EDT) [Subject to change - consider adding raid preferences in your character bio]\n\n##### Participate when you can...\n- Challenges give marks\n- Marks are used for raids\n- Raids give you Combat XP\n\n##### Tips\n- activate Tier 3 shrine + donate 100g to the shrine for extra 5% XP before selling large batches of items\n- fish, cook, and sell to vendor to get gold - sell only what you need for the next batch, wait for the shrine to be active for the rest\n- farm the first expedition to increase Combat levels at the beginning (1200xp for 300g)\n- farm the Oasis boss (combat level 50) to get your first good pets",
